#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40112"
msgid "Is there a checkpoint in that area?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40356"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40892"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41912"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42204"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42672"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43584"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47812"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47856"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631876"
msgid "We can't let #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF travel\noutside the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nLet's head towards the #C000246204pink marker on the map#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "632240"
msgid "Checkpoint unlocked."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "632356"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634576"
msgid "You can't even become either one, so DON'T\nthink you can talk down to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634652"
msgid "Ha! Well said! Getting shot down by a damn fox\nmust mean I've finally lost my edge!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635280"
msgid "Get it? I kill kings for breakfast.\nSuicide, dignity, one-on-ones―none of that\napplies to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635572"
msgid "Yeah, my work here is almost done.\nYou all were looking for your #C000246204Memories#CDEF, right?\nThat's bad. Real bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635760"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF knows we're searching for our #C000246204Memories#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636132"
msgid "You got it. This area is the claw-girl's domain,\nbut she also manages all the inconvenient data."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638192"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638252"
msgid "You didn't imagine it.\nI sense a small mass of data.\nTry looking around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638796"
msgid "What… is this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639828"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "640140"
msgid "\"#C000246204Faceless King#CDEF\" is active."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "640188"
msgid "Due to that, item folders are"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640388"
msgid "Yes, job well done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641104"
msgid "Hm? Please wait, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND. My ears have\ncaught the sound of those sinister claws.\n…behind us, it's HER."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641508"
msgid "…………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641532"
msgid "…………………………………………\n…………………………………………\n…………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641696"
msgid "(…she's staring straight at us.)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641848"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF makes no indication of moving.\nShe's giving us an intense, passionate stare…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641956"
msgid "Should we run, or should we face her―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642008"
msgid "…hey. Just what are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642040"
msgid "Huh…… #C236196003Archer#CDEF…?\nWhat are you, err, doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642216"
msgid "That's because…\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF suddenly disappeared…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642368"
msgid "That's why, I just destroyed them.\n…that's normal, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642436"
msgid "Hahaha. Normal girls don't crush barriers\nmade to keep out Servants when they get angry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642536"
msgid "Y-yeah, I guess so…\nSorry, I'll be more careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642588"
msgid "Um…\nI happen to have a request…\nCould you, hide this data for me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643044"
msgid "Huh…? But I don't like this thing.\nIf I hold on to this, Mother will get mad…\nAh, also, these aren't a waste, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643500"
msgid "Look, if I eat any more… my weight…\nsomething like with body fat,\nin my belly… will, err…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643604"
msgid "A-anyway, I'm using my right, as an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF,\nto order you…\nPlease take this data and deal with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643916"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF and #C236196003Archer#CDEF left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644388"
msgid "Well… It looks like he's up to something\nthis time. Let's keep an eye on #C236196003Archer#CDEF for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644688"
msgid "Come on, forget all about droopy eyes and\nlet's hurry ahead, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645256"
msgid "I'll raise the output on our scans. For now…\nYeah, looks like she isn't nearby."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645636"
msgid "…I wonder what the deal is here.\nAccording to #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF,\nall the item folders are supposed to be transparent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645848"
msgid "Are you making a fool of me?\nIt's an item, can't you see?\nLet's go and get it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648628"
msgid "Please take a look, Darling!\nThis is your old uniform!\nOur keepsake!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648816"
msgid "Hmm, but I wonder.\nPersonally, this makes me happier than any\ncheat item could. Is it just me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649132"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649168"
msgid "This uniform is of no particular value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649216"
msgid "#C236196003Green Archer#CDEF said that \"#C236196003BB#CDEF sealed this here…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649308"
msgid "Why would #C236196003BB#CDEF forbid something like this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649476"
msgid "Ah… ahh… aaahhh…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649504"
msgid "…hey, what's the big deal here?\nI thought I left you to conceal this folder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649592"
msgid "O-ohhh…\nI-I did, properly…\nThe folder turned transparent, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650412"
msgid "I-it's not… empty…\nI just, thought it was kind of a bother…\nI skipped out on it… that's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650628"
msgid "So this is why #C236196003BB#CDEF is always reminding me to\n\"take good care of #C236196003Lip#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650840"
msgid "…I… I-I don't need friends…\nI… don't need any…\nI'm fine… without any…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651032"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is getting an earnest scolding.\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF is getting heated with his candid advice\nand seems to be disregarding us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651360"
msgid "It's natural for #C236196003Archer#CDEF to be angry,\nbut this is unlike him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651836"
msgid "But I'm floored by the irony here.\nI figure that #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's skill is to\nescalate the emotions of her aggressors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652392"
msgid "Excuse me, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs your #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF reacting at all?\nI'm already tugging on her #C000246204SG#CDEF on my end…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652548"
msgid "―――Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652568"
msgid "But we're not doing anything to her.\nIt's just #C236196003Archer#CDEF there, criticizing #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653064"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease give a clear answer as to what\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's trait is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653384"
msgid "If I had to be specific… \"Motherly Love\" maybe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654284"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654300"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654316"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654780"
msgid "But bond with #C236196003Gawain#CDEF increased by 4."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655276"
msgid "…haa… haa… huh…? I'm… fine…\nIt only… tingled a little…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655476"
msgid "…? It's… no problem…\nI don't mind, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655644"
msgid "Running around for nothing wears me out…\nI'll leave the little details to you, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655872"
msgid "――――――.\nI give up. I can't believe all my work\nwas wasted for a reason like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656136"
msgid "Huh…? Why are you bullying me…?\nNo… don't… Kyaa…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656208"
msgid "…when did this turn into kindergarten?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656272"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF, frenzied,\nreaches his hand out to grab hold of #C236196003Lip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656364"
msgid "So I―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "656380"
msgid "Call out, \"HOLD IT!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656428"
msgid "I called out to #C236196003Archer#CDEF, \"HOLD IT!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656900"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF flipped his green cloak around and left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656980"
msgid "All that's left is #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\ndejected after being scolded by #C236196003Archer#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657144"
msgid "My… prince…\nI knew it, you're… my prince…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657208"
msgid "G-good God!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657292"
msgid "―――This has developed into a catastrophe!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657576"
msgid "It's… too late, now…\nAt this point… all I can think about…\nis you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657716"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's red pupils are pointed straight at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657964"
msgid "It's not that #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is looking only at\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658140"
msgid "…yikes.\nAnother crazy took a liking to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658828"
msgid "I can't share any of my secrets.\nPlease… promise you won't try to take my\nsecrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658912"
msgid "I won't be able to bear it if you don't…\nI beg you… Please promise.\nPlease promise… promise, me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659088"
msgid "…she wasn't talking to herself.\n#C236196003Lip#CDEF's voice, filled only with sadness,\npleads for me to \"not take the #C000246204Memories#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659244"
msgid "But I can't make that promise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659324"
msgid "I have to know who #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "659920"
msgid "No, I can't fight her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "659944"
msgid "No, rather, let's talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659972"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF gradually approaches.\n…and then.\nShe stopped abruptly, and fancifully misdirected her gaze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660544"
msgid "Next time I'll heel her right in the mammoths!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660688"
msgid "Talk…?\nHuh, err, umm… y-you'll\ntalk to me, really…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660816"
msgid "And that's ANOTHER out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661112"
msgid "…………\n………………\n……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661244"
msgid "…I was hasty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661444"
msgid "I told you so.\nDo something about this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661716"
msgid "*kgh*… Useless #SVT[Emperor][Servant][\"good\" wife][King of Heroes]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661788"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's gaze stings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661892"
msgid "………yes.\nI think so too.\nI like my name, \"#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662076"
msgid "Umm… I did.\nMother… that woman, she told me to\nname myself whatever I wanted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662284"
msgid "Passion flower? Tulip?\nMaybe it's a combination of both."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664412"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, she's here…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664460"
msgid "Eh… wha, aaahhh…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664620"
msgid "*tsk*. Creeping up behind us all sneaky―\nso THAT'S how you do things,#RUBSOppai Monster#RUBE O-P-M#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664968"
msgid "U-umm…\nS-s-sorry…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665008"
msgid "Sh-she ran…?\n…she really does look like a stalker…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665064"
msgid "There are still signs of #C236196003Lip#CDEF.\nI marked her approximate location again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665376"
msgid "!!!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665516"
msgid "I've jumped over so many hurdles up until now,\nbut damn, I didn't think there would be a boss\nthat runs away when you get too close…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666156"
msgid "If you find yourself at an impasse,\nplease head on back here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666300"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "666696"
msgid "Stay still."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666712"
msgid "…!\nG-g-good, bye…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666752"
msgid "…she got away…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666860"
msgid "…………\n……………………\n………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666944"
msgid "It seems as if #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is dropping her guard somewhat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667064"
msgid "…um…\nMay I, go over to you…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667112"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667124"
msgid "We mustn't jump the gun here.\nI accept with a silent nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667604"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF attentively confronts\nthe approaching #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667696"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "667712"
msgid "Fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667736"
msgid "No. #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667788"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right, we have to fight back…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667848"
msgid "I knew it… As long as your Servant is around…\nI can't get close to you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…\nYOU… You're in my way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668544"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's expression lights up with a flash,\nand she rushes over to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668652"
msgid "Cookies… Regular, edible cookies?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668688"
msgid "Err… y-yes, here they are…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669708"
msgid "Ah……………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669776"
msgid "A second time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669852"
msgid "Do all the nutrients go straight to her chest!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670528"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF is a one trick pony.\nWe can beat her if we just get some practice…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671588"
msgid "If Mother finds me, I'll get modified again…\nI won't be an obstacle,\nfor #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, anymore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671700"
msgid "…huff… huff… hu…\nAhaha… I feel kind of… fuzzy inside…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671880"
msgid "…………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671916"
msgid "Huh…?\nWhy are you here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671956"
msgid "!\nKyaaah……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671976"
msgid "…………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672012"
msgid "Ah……, ah……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672092"
msgid "…………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672176"
msgid "I'm, not afraid.\nI'm not afraid anymore, Sen―pa―――"
msgstr ""

